==Acquisition==
*The [[Strain Set]] is rewarded by completing [[Profit-Taker Orb]] [[Heist]]s from {{Faction|Vox Solaris}}, or from enemies in [[Bounty#Deepmines Bounties|Deepmine Bounties]] (both in [[Fortuna]]).

==Notes==
*Unlike other mod sets, ''all'' mods in this set revolve around enhancing the Set Bonus, as opposed to some that can be used for general purposes.
*The [[Strain Set]] mods cannot interact with {{WF|Nidus}}'s abilities or the maggots spawned by the {{Weapon|Pathocyst}}.

